@end example

@cindex security layer
@file{codebud_sec} is a separate layer over the core: the core never
imports it, and it imports only the core modules listed in
@file{tests/test_layers.py} (today @file{fsutil} and @file{crypto}),
which enforces both rules.  General privacy
features that the security profiles switch on stay in the core, where
every user can have them.
